IEEE 1516.2(TM)-2025 OMT schemas, MIM, and example modules

Reprinted with permission from IEEE 1516.2(TM)-2025.

The unmodified resources under resources/ were supplied in the official
HLA-4 XML submission archive. Each schema and the standard MIM retain their
complete IEEE license notice. Umbra copies the source bytes unchanged and
records their SHA-256 digests in resource-digests.json.

Umbra additions are limited to this NOTICE, manifest.json,
resource-digests.json, and tools/ieee_1516_2_resources.py; they are not part
of the IEEE resource set.
